# Game speed whatever the frame rate (input.c, gamepad_input): two shots 3 s apart; at 7 units a
# step and 60 steps a second the cycle rides ~1260 between them, at 60 fps or slower.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 12.4
shot speed_a
wait 3
shot speed_b
